  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Homes for Ukraine (HfU) scheme ODA spend on benefits</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DWP&apos;s ODA spend for Ukrainian nationals and their eligible family members who have arrived under the Homes for Ukraine Scheme. The benefits that count under ODA and therefore make up the spend are Universal Credit, Pension Credit, Attendance Allowance, Personal Independence Payments and child Disability Living Allowance.</narrative>
  </description>
